# The Immortal Lu Shang (outlands 196), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted with the lumber, the broken rod
# and a Light Crystal, and Quest[5][196]Prog 1 (GMs). Irmilant: the trade, 78; finished: npcUtil.completeQuest
# (Lu Shang's Fishing Rod, the title, completed), then San d'Oria and Bastok fame +10 and the trade confirmed.
# npcUtil.completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[5][196]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Rabao pos=3.78,9.54,56.21
quest Outlands.TheImmortalLuShang accepted
item PieceOfAncientLumber
item BrokenLuShangsFishingRod
item LightCrystal
charvar Quest[5][196]Prog 1     # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trade Irmilant PieceOfAncientLumber x1 BrokenLuShangsFishingRod x1 LightCrystal x1   # 78
finish                          # the rod; the title; completed, Prog kept; fame; the trade taken
